          "kicker": "Ranking record",
          "heading": "Fiji aim to reclaim historic seventh spot after three opening defeats",
          "body": "Fiji head into their upcoming Round four fixture against France sitting bottom of the 12-team Nations Championship table. In their first three matches of the tournament, the Flying Fijians have suffered three defeats. Across those three fixtures, they have scored 49 points. The defence has conceded 145 points over the same period, following a 17-33 loss to Scotland in Round three. This form sits in stark contrast to 2023, when Fiji achieved their best world ranking of No. 7."
