          "kicker": "Frank admission",
          "heading": "Peter O'Mahony reveals Rassie Erasmus leaving Munster left him deeply hurt",
          "body": "Former Ireland captain Peter O’Mahony has admitted that Rassie Erasmus’ sudden Munster departure in 2017 left him deeply hurt. Speaking on the Indo Sport podcast to promote his new book, 'All In', the flanker reflected on the Springbok coach's exit alongside Jacques Nienaber. \"I was hurt because I trusted him and I was all into his game plan, and I was driving that for him,\" O'Mahony revealed. While conceding sport is ruthless, the veteran forward admitted losing such vital direction was difficult."
