          "heading": "Uruguayan international flanker Lucas Bianchi signs for Italian club Viadana",
          "body": "Uruguayan international flanker Lucas Bianchi has secured his future by signing for Italian club Viadana from Super Rugby Americas side Peñarol. The 25-year-old, who represented Uruguay at the 2023 Rugby World Cup and holds 29 test caps for Los Teros, joins the Serie A Elite team ahead of the European season. Bianchi has recently captained both Peñarol and the Uruguay XV, and his move to Italy comes just under one year before the 2027 Rugby World Cup."
