          "heading": "Josh Adams targets Wales return next month following calf injury layoff",
          "body": "Wales wing Josh Adams has confirmed he expects to return to action this month with Cardiff, ensuring his availability for November's international fixtures. The 31-year-old missed the summer tour defeat to South Africa with a calf injury but is back in training. With the 2027 World Cup in Australia now one year away, the British and Irish Lions test star is targeting a third global tournament. \"I'm desperate to go, but there is loads of rugby to be played and months ahead of us,\" Adams said."
